.termigo/

# Local security audit reports (not for public repo)
SECURITY-AUDIT-*.md

# Built binaries & headless-safeguard artifacts (build/ops output, not source)
#
# Anchored to the repository root on purpose. Without the leading slash these
# match at ANY depth, and a bare `termigo` silently swallowed the whole
# `npm/termigo/` install package - `git status` showed a clean tree while an
# entire new directory sat untracked. Every entry below is a root-level build
# product, so rooting them is what was meant all along.
/termigo
termigo-cli
termigo.known-good
termigo.prev-*
.watchdog/
scripts/run-headless-debug.sh
run-headless.sh
